Package: baas-capture-agent
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: BAAS project <baas@localhost>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-fprint-2.0, libfprint-2-2
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://baas-app-kappa.vercel.app
Description: Fingerprint capture service for the BAAS web kiosk
 Reads a fingerprint image from a DigitalPersona U.are.U 4500 (libfprint
 uru4000 driver) and hands it to the BAAS kiosk in the browser as a PNG.
 Listens on 127.0.0.1 only and answers only the configured kiosk origins.
